  ('examen-ep2-presente-s-03', 'examen-ep2', 3, 'escuchar', '{"opciones": ["He works on Saturdays.", "He work on Saturdays.", "He walks on Saturdays."], "correcta": 0, "audio": "He works on Saturdays.", "es": "Él trabaja los sábados.", "explicacion": "works con -s."}'::jsonb, 'ep2-presente-s', 'input', true),
